      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i feel like i have a pretty good handle on it. my doctor just told me to keep things consistent, but i feel like i'm not being consistent enough with the healthy stuff. its hard to motivate myself to eat even a little bit of greens every day, so i figured if i just loaded up on them all at once i could get the benefits faster. do u think its really that big of a deal if i just do a big green juice every morning? i'm pretty much a healthy eater anyway.",
